WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
- When I have the
funniest thing to tell you

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.850
I was literally reading
my script last night

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.300
and I know you from things

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.590
and I, but I did not know
that your dad was Bono.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:11.451
I had no idea.

00:00:11.451 --> 00:00:13.820
I didn't know, I only know him as Bono.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.150
Like I didn't know what his real name was

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.613
until I Googled last night.

00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:18.800
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.930
- His real name is Paul.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:22.650
It's a very unrockstar kind of name.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.300
- [Kelly] It's very biblical. Yes.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.020
I can't imagine like having
such a massive star for a parent

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.260
and then trying to get the business.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.340
Like people probably don't
recognize that right off the bat.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.450
Is that kind of cool?

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.810
- It's good. It's good.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.450
I mean, yeah, nobody knows my last name.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.280
So nobody knows who I am,
which is actually kind of fun.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.140
- Yeah.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.650
- I'm lucky I'm not like a Jagger

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.300
or McCartney or something like that.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.133
- No, that's what I'm saying.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.460
It's actually, I think I
get like why people would

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.590
be proud of it, but I think if it were me,

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.140
if I were you, I would
love that nobody knows

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.150
the last name of it.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:54.983
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:54.983 --> 00:00:56.210
And you get to have your own.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.190
You've gotten your, you
made your mark on your own.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.430
That's like the coolest thing ever.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.280
Anyway, I'm always a fan of you.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.751
And then I was like, "Oh, I had no idea."

00:01:02.751 --> 00:01:06.590
So anyway, I called you
Eve, speaking of names,

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.020
but that's not even your
name. I Googled you.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.020
You have like a thousand names.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.615
Can you tell us your full name?

00:01:12.615 --> 00:01:13.540
(chuckles)

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.160
- It's very embarrassing.
My parents were hippies.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.268
I, there's nothing. I don't
know how to explain this.

00:01:18.268 --> 00:01:19.559
- Yeah.

00:01:19.559 --> 00:01:24.559
- But my real name is Memphis
Eve Sunny Day Iris Hewson.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:27.260
- Okay, here's the thing
I'm going to tell you

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:28.800
this is how I found out who your dad was.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.830
I literally was going through the thing

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.730
and I saw one of the
questions in the script

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.800
and I was like, "Wait, what's her name?"

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.410
And I was like, "Oh, her
parents were stoners."

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.410
I was like they've had to been stoners.

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.290
And then all of a sudden, the
next question was about Bono.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.437
And I was like, "Oh my God, I nailed it!"

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.482
(laughs)

00:01:45.482 --> 00:01:46.315
- You did.

00:01:46.315 --> 00:01:48.590
No, I really am the poster
child for, you know,

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.064
those people magazines
like "Celebrity kids,

00:01:51.064 --> 00:01:53.010
the craziest names" like that's me.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.479
That's who I am.

00:01:54.479 --> 00:01:55.840
- You know what, though.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.000
You are all those names.
You claim all of those.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.220
It's a beautiful name. All of them.

